WEBVTT

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.280
- Liam Foxwell, selamat datang.
- Terima kasih.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.400
Baik, sedikit pidato.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.240
Aku sudah beri tahu
tentang penilaian mereka,

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.960
