00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:16.160
Bagus. Nikmati perjalananmu, Tuan Foxwell.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:23.080
Aku tak melucu, tapi lihatlah.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:24.800
